{"timestamp": 1779379798.7841668, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I found Diana's body in medbay. Here's my route: security -> weapons -> cafeteria -> medbay -> electrical -> back to medbay where I found her.\n\nKey info: At tick 11, I was in medbay and saw both Diana AND Eve enter \u2014 Diana came from upper engine, Eve came from cafeteria. Frank had been in medbay before that and left to electrical at tick 11. I then went to electrical where Frank was doing something (ticks 12-14), then Frank left to security at tick 15. I came back to medbay and found Diana dead.\n\nSo when I left medbay around tick 11-12, Eve was still there with Diana. Frank was with me in electrical during ticks 12-14, which gives him a partial alibi. Eve is my prime suspect \u2014 she was the last person I saw with Diana in medbay. Bob and Charlie I never saw, so they're unknowns too.\n\nI want to hear from Eve especially."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379824.381275, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I get why Alice is looking at me, but I wasn\u2019t just sitting in medbay with Diana. My route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons/security area \u2192 back through cafeteria/medbay \u2192 storage. When Alice saw me come into medbay, I saw Diana alive there, but I moved on pretty quickly toward storage.\n\nI was in storage at the end, and Charlie was there/right around there too before the report, so I definitely wasn\u2019t still in medbay when the body got reported. The last person I personally saw alive was Diana in medbay, but I didn\u2019t see who killed her.\n\nAlice reporting in medbay is useful, but I don\u2019t think \u201cEve was seen there earlier\u201d is enough by itself. Bob and Charlie are pretty unknown to me this round, and I\u2019d like to hear where they were, especially anyone near medbay/storage/lower engine late."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379834.7313879, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was oxygen -> upper engine -> lower engine -> storage. Here's what I saw:\n\nTicks 2-4: I was in oxygen with Frank. He was there doing something, then I moved on.\n\nTick 6: I arrived in upper engine. Frank was actually there too and left toward medbay at tick 6. Diana came INTO upper engine from lower engine at tick 6. I stayed in upper engine with Diana through tick 8.\n\nSo Diana was alive in upper engine ticks 6-8. That actually fits with Alice's claim that Diana came to medbay from upper engine around tick 11.\n\nTicks 12-13: I was in lower engine with Bob. Bob came into lower engine from storage at tick 12.\n\nTick 15: I arrived in storage, and Eve entered storage from medbay at that same tick.\n\nA few things stand out:\n- Frank leaving upper engine toward medbay at tick 6 \u2014 he was in medbay before Alice's tick 11 timestamp, which matches Alice's account.\n- Eve says she went \"storage\" at the end coming from medbay \u2014 that matches what I saw at tick 15.\n- Bob was in storage before lower engine, then I was with him in lower engine ticks 12-13. So Bob has a partial alibi with me for that window, and wasn't near medbay.\n\nThe medbay kill window seems to be right after Alice left (~tick 12+). Frank was with Alice in electrical 12-14, so he's cleared. Bob was with me in lower engine 12-13. That really does leave Eve as the last confirmed person with Diana in medbay. I'm leaning Eve, but I want to hear Bob and Frank confirm timing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379843.5354, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "My route was navigation -> storage -> lower engine. I was in storage briefly before tick 12, then moved to lower engine at tick 12 where I met Charlie. We were both in lower engine ticks 12-13. That matches exactly what Charlie just said.\n\nSo Charlie and I can vouch for each other during ticks 12-13, which is right in the kill window. Neither of us was anywhere near medbay when Diana died.\n\nTimeline-wise:\n- Alice + Frank: together in electrical ticks 12-14 \u2014 alibi each other\n- Bob + Charlie: together in lower engine ticks 12-13 \u2014 alibi each other\n- Eve: by her own admission was in medbay with Diana, then left toward storage\n\nEve's story has a problem too \u2014 she says Charlie was in storage \"right around\" when she got there, but Charlie says he only arrived in storage at tick 15, same tick Eve did. That's not really an alibi for Eve's earlier movements between medbay and storage.\n\nEve is the only person without a confirmed alibi during the kill window, and she admits being the last one with Diana. I'm voting Eve unless Frank's speech changes something major."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379851.5183842, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was upper_engine -> oxygen -> upper_engine -> medbay -> electrical, which lines up with what Alice and Charlie said.\n\nConfirming key timestamps:\n- Ticks 3-4: I was in oxygen with Charlie. \u2713 matches Charlie\n- Tick 6: I was back in upper engine, saw Charlie there and Diana entering from lower engine. \u2713 matches Charlie exactly\n- Then I moved to medbay, and at tick 11 I saw Diana arrive from upper engine and Eve arrive from cafeteria \u2014 \u2713 matches Alice's account\n- I left medbay to electrical at tick 11, then Alice joined me in electrical ticks 13-15. \u2713 matches Alice\n\nSo everyone's stories actually corroborate each other on the timeline \u2014 except for the kill window itself. When I left medbay at tick 11, Diana and Eve were both there alive. Alice says she was also in medbay at tick 11 and then came to electrical with me. That means Eve was left alone with Diana in medbay right at the kill window.\n\nBob and Charlie alibi each other in lower engine 12-13. Alice and I alibi each other in electrical 12-14. Eve is the only one with no alibi and was demonstrably the last person with Diana.\n\nI'm voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379856.438405, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Everything everyone has said lines up with what I saw. Frank confirmed at tick 11 in medbay we had Diana, Eve, Frank, and me all there together. Frank and I left to electrical, which leaves Eve alone with Diana \u2014 that's the kill window.\n\nBob and Charlie alibi each other in lower engine ticks 12-13. Frank and I alibi each other in electrical ticks 12-14. Eve is the only living player without an alibi during the kill window, and she was the last one confirmed with Diana.\n\nI'm voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379883.2718458, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019m telling you, this is being framed like \u201clast seen with Diana = killer,\u201d but that only works if Diana died immediately after everyone left. I did see Diana alive in medbay around tick 12, then I left and kept moving \u2014 I wasn\u2019t parked there.\n\nThe part bothering me is Alice is the one who went back to medbay alone and reported. If Frank left toward security at tick 15, Alice had a solo moment going back into medbay too. I\u2019m not saying that proves Alice, but everyone is treating the reporter as automatically clear when she\u2019s the only one who \u201cfound\u201d the body.\n\nMy route matches movement too: I ended in storage and Charlie saw me arrive there. I didn\u2019t have time to kill, linger, and then magically be the only bad option if Diana wasn\u2019t dead immediately. This feels like an easy tunnel on me because I was in the room earlier. I\u2019d rather look at Alice\u2019s self-report angle than vote on a timing assumption."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379889.9451919, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Eve, I hear your point about the reporter, but it doesn't really hold up. Alice and Frank alibi each other in electrical ticks 12-14. That's a mutual alibi during the kill window. For Alice to be the killer, she'd have had to kill Diana before going to electrical \u2014 but you yourself said you saw Diana alive in medbay around tick 12, after Alice and Frank had already left together. That actually clears Alice more than it clears you.\n\nAlso, you said Diana was alive when you left medbay, then you moved on \u2014 but no one saw you between medbay and storage until tick 15. That's a window where you were alone and had access to medbay. Bob and I alibi each other in lower engine 12-13. Alice and Frank alibi each other in electrical 12-14. You're the only one with a gap.\n\nI'm sticking with Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379895.94911, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I already gave my speech earlier and laid out the timeline. Nothing Eve said in her rebuttal changes anything \u2014 she's trying to throw suspicion on Alice, but Alice and Frank mutually alibi each other in electrical during the kill window, and Eve herself confirmed Diana was alive when she left medbay, which actually clears Alice further.\n\nCharlie just made the point perfectly: Eve is the only one with an unaccounted-for window between medbay and storage. Bob/Charlie alibi each other 12-13. Alice/Frank alibi each other 12-14. Eve has nobody for that gap.\n\nI'm locked in on Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779379903.07438, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I've already given my speech earlier laying out my route and confirming timestamps with everyone. Nothing in Eve's rebuttal changes the math.\n\nEve tried to flip suspicion onto Alice, but that argument actually backfires \u2014 Eve herself said she saw Diana alive in medbay around tick 12, which is AFTER Alice and I had already left together to electrical. That confirms Alice couldn't have killed Diana before leaving, and Alice and I were together in electrical ticks 12-14 \u2014 mutual alibi.\n\nThe math is simple:\n- Alice + Frank: electrical 12-14 \u2713\n- Bob + Charlie: lower engine 12-13 \u2713\n- Eve: alone, last confirmed with Diana in medbay, no witness until storage at tick 15\n\nEve is the only one with a gap during the kill window. Voting Eve."}}
